; Part of ferrum. MIT licence, see ferrum/LICENSE.
; Guarded positioning move for the probe macros: one incremental move by
; [dx] [dy] [dz] (machine units, current program coordinates) made as a
; "probe towards, no error" move (G38.3) at the probe traverse feed #3017.
; If the probe touches anything on the way the move stops and the macro
; aborts, so a positioning move can never push the stylus into the part.
; A move shorter than a micron is skipped. Leaves G90.
o<ferrum_guarded_move> sub
#<dx> = #1
#<dy> = #2
#<dz> = #3
o100 if [#3017 LE 0]
    (ABORT, Probe traverse feed #3017 must be positive)
o100 endif
o110 if [[ABS[#<dx>] + ABS[#<dy>] + ABS[#<dz>]] GT 0.000001]
    G91 G38.3 X#<dx> Y#<dy> Z#<dz> F#3017
    G90
    o120 if [#5070 EQ 1]
        (ABORT, Probe made unexpected contact during a positioning move)
    o120 endif
o110 endif
G90
o<ferrum_guarded_move> endsub
M2
